1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,682
Cytokinin also delays ageing.

2
00:00:02,682 --> 00:00:04,934
Put a drop on a detached leaf.

3
00:00:04,934 --> 00:00:13,229
As days pass the rest of the leaf turns yellow, but the treated spot stays green, and even pulls nutrients towards it.

4
00:00:13,229 --> 00:00:15,026
That is the Richmond Lang effect.

5
00:00:15,026 --> 00:00:20,546
Cytokinins also wake lateral buds, working against apical dominance.

